<title>USA: Pfizer Inc ups quarterly, plans split.</title>
<headline>Pfizer Inc ups quarterly, plans split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pfizer Inc said on Thursday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.34 per share from $0.30 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on March 13 to shareholders of record on Feb 7.</p>
<p>Pfizer also said its board plans to vote on a two-for-one stock split, in the form of a stock dividend, on April 24 when the company holds its annual meeting.</p>
<p>At the meeting the company will vote on a proposal to increase the authorized shares of Pfizer common stock. If it were a favorable vote, Pfizer would consider the stock split.</p>
</text>
